    fullDescription: "Account Takeover (ATO) — один з найбільш поширених і дорогих видів онлайн-шахрайства.\n\nВектори атак: credential stuffing (підбір з витоків), phishing, SIM swapping (обхід SMS 2FA), session hijacking, malware/keylogger.\n\nML-сигнали для ATO:\n1. Geo-Jump: фізично неможливе переміщення\n2. Device fingerprint change: нова ОС + браузер + мова\n3. Behavioral biometrics anomaly: нетипова швидкість набору\n4. Unusual actions: перший-ever password change + transfer out\n5. Time-of-day anomaly: о 3:00 ночі vs звичні 9-18\n6. Velocity: 500 req/хвилину (credential stuffing)\n\nМоделі: UEBA (baseline + anomaly), Graph ML (мережа пов'язаних ATO), Ensemble.\n\nFCA: Payment Services Regulations 2017 → банки зобов'язані мати контрзаходи від ATO.",
    shortDescriptionEn: "A type of fraud where an attacker gains unauthorised access to an account through stolen credentials, phishing, or credential stuffing. ML detects ATO through a combination of anomalies: geo-jump, novel behaviour, unusual actions.",
    fullDescriptionEn: "Account Takeover (ATO) is one of the most common and costly types of online fraud.\n\nAttack vectors: credential stuffing (using leaked credentials), phishing, SIM swapping (bypassing SMS 2FA), session hijacking, malware/keyloggers.\n\nML signals for ATO:\n1. Geo-Jump: physically impossible travel\n2. Device fingerprint change: a new OS, browser and language combination\n3. Behavioural biometrics anomaly: atypical typing speed\n4. Unusual actions: a first-ever password change followed by an outgoing transfer\n5. Time-of-day anomaly: activity at 3am versus the usual 9-6\n6. Velocity: 500 requests/minute (credential stuffing)\n\nModels: UEBA (baseline plus anomaly detection), Graph ML (networks of linked ATO cases), ensembles.\n\nFCA: the Payment Services Regulations 2017 require banks to have countermeasures against ATO.",
    exampleEn: "A UK challenger bank combined UEBA with behavioural biometrics and geo-jump detection. ATO incidents fell from 347 to 82/month (-76%). Mean time to detect: 4.2 days to 18 minutes. Fraud losses: -£2.1M/year.",
    example: "UK challenger bank: UEBA з behavioral biometrics + geo-jump. ATO: 347 → 82/місяць (−76%). MTTD: 4.2 дні → 18 хв. Fraud losses: −£2.1M/рік.",
