    exampleEn: "UK fintech deploying credit scoring ML: FCA is the primary AI oversight body (not a new AI regulator). FCA applies Consumer Duty and SR 11/7 model risk principles. ICO handles GDPR Article 22 automated decisions. No separate AI Act compliance needed for UK-only deployment.",
